# Interview Modules documentation

## Context source

Before changing Interview Modules behavior, read `docs/interview_modules.md` for current models, APIs, UI tabs, and business rules.

Interview Modules lives under **Admin → Interview Screening → Interview Modules** tab (`AdminCurationSection` embeds `AdminInterviewModulesSection`). There is no separate sidebar item.

## Keep the doc updated

After any implementation that touches this feature, update `docs/interview_modules.md` in the same change set:

- New/changed API routes or request/response shapes
- Schema field additions/removals on `InterviewModule` or `InterviewSession`
- Admin UI flow changes (Screening tabs, Modules inner tabs, applicant selector, save session, history)
- Relationship changes with Interview Screening, Quiz Zone copy, or developer feedback
- New business rules or file paths

Keep the doc accurate and concise; prefer editing existing sections over appending duplicate notes.

## Related paths (typical)

- `server/models/InterviewModule.js`, `server/models/InterviewSession.js`
- `server/controllers/interviewModuleController.js`, `server/controllers/interviewController.js`
- `server/routes/interviewModules.js`, admin interview routes
- `client/src/pages/admin/AdminInterviewModulesSection.jsx`
- `client/src/pages/admin/AdminCurationSection.jsx` (hosts Modules tab + Session/Sessions)
- `client/src/pages/DeveloperInterviewFeedback.jsx`
